face-container-low transition-colors duration-200 font-body-md text-body-md\" href=\"#\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">description</span>\n                        Documentation\n                    </a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- User Profile Snippet -->\n<div class=\"mt-md px-md py-sm flex items-center gap-sm\">\n<img alt=\"Engineer Avatar\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover bg-surface-variant shrink-0\" data-alt=\"A professional headshot of a software engineer in a modern office setting. The lighting is bright and even, highlighting their features. They are wearing a smart casual dark shirt. The background is slightly blurred showing glass partitions and office plants, typical of a tech company environment. The overall tone is corporate, modern, and reliable.\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAiX49viCtphL5C4-ityXhtBk2PMb-2l8K-v64WXgdREzMlZ0Q2ive0b1nDg8HWYHS8FgbC3LFmvG76_T7MMhkkVhq-rwrY6aeAP9rhcZrO-96DthFhHDVvHi-LKg-hosQM4iEuIrtefv4pTU1P-lnEG69tYAruh01t8xC_z_-m3M7uiq1CINCvp2DRkpe1vngvn2bHSZXoq1Rwp6aNSrLXhEv3dYVJIyx_-ShRkpfAjQqwDTNTNgTHOGl4-Zqum8QoUxkXKp0R37fW\"/>\n<div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n<p class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface truncate font-semibold\">Alex Chen</p>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant truncate\">alex.chen@kms.engine</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<!-- Main Content Area -->\n<main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col h-screen overflow-hidden relative w-full\">\n<!-- TopNavBar -->\n<header class=\"bg-surface dark:bg-surface h-[56px] w-full border-b border-outline-variant dark:border-outline-variant sticky top-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-between px-lg transition-all duration-150 shrink-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-xl h-full\">\n<!-- Mobile Menu Toggle -->\n<button class=\"md:hidden text-on-surface-variant p-sm rounded hover:bg-surface-container-low dark:hover:bg-surface-container-lowest transition-colors\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">menu</span>\n</button>\n<!-- Search Bar -->\n<div class=\"relative hidden sm:block w-64\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined absolute left-sm top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[18px] text-on-surface-variant\">search</span>\n<input class=\"w-full h-8 pl-8 pr-sm bg-surface-container-low border border-outline-variant rounded font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface placeholder:text-on-surface-variant focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary focus:border-transparent transition-all\" placeholder=\"Search resources...\" type=\"text\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-md h-full\">\n<!-- Nav Links (Desktop) -->\n<nav class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-md h-full mr-md\">\n<a class=\"text-on-surface-variant dark:text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low dark:hover:bg-surface-container-lowest px-sm py-xs rounded transition-colors font-body-md text-body-md h-full flex items-center\" href=\"#\">Docs</a>\n<a class=\"text-on-surface-variant dark:text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low dark:hover:bg-surface-container-lowest px-sm py-xs rounded transition-colors font-body-md text-body-md h-full flex items-center\" href=\"#\">Support</a>\n</nav>\n<!-- Icon Actions -->\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-xs border-r border-outline-variant pr-md mr-xs\">\n<button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low dark:hover:bg-surface-container-lowest transition-colors relative\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">notifications</span>\n<span class=\"absolute top-1.5 right-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-error rounded-full\"></span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low dark:hover:bg-surface-container-lowest transition-colors\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">help_outline</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<!-- Trailing Primary Action -->\n<button class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-xs px-md h-8 bg-surface-variant text-on-surface rounded font-label-md text-label-md hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">bolt</span>\n                    Quick Add\n                </button>\n<!-- Mobile Profile (Hidden on desktop sidebar) -->\n<img alt=\"User Profile\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover md:hidden border border-outline-variant\" data-alt=\"A small circular avatar of a software engineer, used for mobile navigation profiling. Bright lighting, professional appearance, dark background.\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCp-7SiDofYSfHK1uNEIzxbeeejd4LpNoB_BS3xrN0S3zMHoApyEC1ygYyQdi-79iN7KWe55ky_gWhtPpUMM0qocmJzuv85_OOtA_Kn5mJ6NKXtwqpDHRfUQTFaUEleObJkQyVCZB9yeoaeXURk79y5abxKYfaLG-TJeBBCu952LdhkrWBRLPKcbZRXmywH1smoieKysxvtxuY_BeIQWDR_BgVS6pHxlmsDK0XZhBxjxg4bYFLyCv9PfDegXnBLHxuHBkW4zoNs5M0p\"/>\n</div>\n</header>\n<!-- Page Content Scrollable Canvas -->\n<div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-md lg:p-lg\">\n<div class=\"max-w-container-max mx-auto w-full flex flex-col gap-lg\">\n<!-- Page Header -->\n<div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-md\">\n<div>\n<h1 class=\"font-h1 text-h1 font-bold text-on-surface tracking-tight\">Internal Tracker</h1>\n<p class=\"font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mt-xs\">Team effort and velocity analytics for Q3.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-sm\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center bg-surface-container-low rounded p-xs border border-outline-variant\">\n<button class=\"px-md py-xs rounded bg-surface shadow-sm font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface border border-outline-variant\">7 Days</button>\n<button class=\"px-md py-xs rounded font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors\">30 Days</button>\n<button class=\"px-md py-xs rounded font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors\">Qtr</button>\n</div>\n<button class=\"h-[32px] px-md bg-secondary text-on-secondary rounded flex items-center gap-xs font-label-md text-label-md hover:bg-opacity-90 transition-opacity\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">download</span>\n                            Export\n                        </button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Bento Grid Layout for Analytics -->\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-md\">\n<!-- KPI Card 1: Velocity -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface border border-outline-variant rounded-lg p-md flex flex-col justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-sm\">\n<h3 class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider\">Team Velocity</h3>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] text-primary\">speed</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-sm\">\n<span class=\"font-h1 text-h1 font-bold text-on-surface\">42.8</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">pts/sprint</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-xs mt-xs text-[12px] font-medium text-[#16a34a] dark:text-[#4ade80]\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">trending_up</span>\n                                +12% from last month\n                            </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- KPI Card 2: Open Tickets -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface border border-outline-variant rounded-lg p-md flex flex-col justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-sm\">\n<h3 class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider\">Active Tickets</h3>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] text-tertiary\">bug_report</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-sm\">\n<span class=\"font-h1 text-h1 font-bold text-on-surface\">18</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">critical</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-xs mt-xs text-[12px] font-medium text-error\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">trending_up</span>\n                                +3 this week\n                            </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- KPI Card 3: Resolution Time -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface border border-outline-variant rounded-lg p-md flex flex-col justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-sm\">\n<h3 class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider\">Avg Resolution</h3>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] text-secondary\">timer</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-sm\">\n<span class=\"font-h1 text-h1 font-bold text-on-surface\">4.2</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">days</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-xs mt-xs text-[12px] font-medium text-[#16a34a] dark:text-[#4ade80]\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">trending_down</span>\n                                -0.8 days faster\n                            </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- KPI Card 4: Uptime -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface border border-outline-variant rounded-lg p-md flex flex-col justify-between md:hidden lg:flex\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-sm\">\n<h3 class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider\">System Uptime</h3>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] text-primary\">cloud_done</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-sm\">\n<span class=\"font-h1 text-h1 font-bold text-on-surface\">99.9</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-xs mt-xs text-[12px] font-medium text-on-surface-variant\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">check_circle</span>\n                                Target met\n                            </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Large Chart Area: Sprint Burndown (Spans 2 or 3 cols) -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface border border-outline-variant rounded-lg p-md md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-3 flex flex-col\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-md\">\n<h3 class=\"font-h3 text-h3 font-semibold text-on-surface\">Sprint Burndown</h3>\n<button class=\"p-xs text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container rounded transition-colors\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">more_vert</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<!-- Simulated Chart Canvas -->\n<div class=\"flex-1 min-h-[240px] relative w-full rounded border border-outline-variant bg-surface-bright flex items-end p-md gap-sm overflow-hidden group cursor-crosshair\">\n<!-- Y-Axis Labels -->\n<div class=\"absolute left-sm top-sm bottom-sm w-8 flex flex-col justify-between text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant font-mono\">\n<span>60</span>\n<span>40</span>\n<span>20</span>\n<span>0</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Grid Lines -->\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 pl-xl pr-sm py-sm flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none opacity-20\">\n<div class=\"w-full border-t border-outline-variant\"></div>\n<div class=\"w-full border-t border-outline-variant\"></div>\n<div class=\"w-full border-t border-outline-variant\"></div>\n<div class=\"w-full border-t border-outline-variant\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- Chart Bars (Simulated Data) -->\n<div class=\"flex-1 flex items-end justify-around h-full pl-xl relative z-10\">\n<!-- Day 1 -->\n<div class=\"w-full max-w-[40px] flex flex-col items-center gap-xs group/bar\">\n<div class=\"w-full bg-primary opacity-80 h-[90%] rounded-t-sm hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity relative\">\n<div class=\"absolute -top-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-inverse-surface text-inverse-on-surface font-label-md text-[10px] py-[2px] px-xs rounded opacity-0 group-hover/bar:opacity-100 transition-opacity whitespace-nowrap pointer-events-none\">58 pts</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant\">Mon</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Day 2 -->\n<div class=\"w-full max-w-[40px] flex flex-col items-center gap-xs group/bar\">\n<div class=\"w-full bg-primary opacity-80 h-[80%] rounded-t-sm hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity relative\">\n<div class=\"absolute -top-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-inverse-surface text-inverse-on-surface font-label-md text-[10px] py-[2px] px-xs rounded opacity-0 group-hover/bar:opacity-100 transition-opacity whitespace-nowrap pointer-events-none\">48 pts</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant\">Tue</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Day 3 -->\n<div class=\"w-full max-w-[40px] flex flex-col items-center gap-xs group/bar\">\n<div class=\"w-full bg-primary opacity-80 h-[65%] rounded-t-sm hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity relative\">\n<div class=\"absolute -top-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-inverse-surface text-inverse-on-surface font-label-md text-[10px] py-[2px] px-xs rounded opacity-0 group-hover/bar:opacity-100 transition-opacity whitespace-nowrap pointer-events-none\">39 pts</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant\">Wed</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Day 4 -->\n<div class=\"w-full max-w-[40px] flex flex-col items-center gap-xs group/bar\">\n<div class=\"w-full bg-primary opacity-80 h-[45%] rounded-t-sm hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity relative\">\n<div class=\"absolute -top-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-inverse-surface text-inverse-on-surface font-label-md text-[10px] py-[2px] px-xs rounded opacity-0 group-hover/bar:opacity-100 transition-opacity whitespace-nowrap pointer-events-none\">27 pts</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant font-bold\">Thu</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Day 5 (Today) -->\n<div class=\"w-full max-w-[40px] flex flex-col items-center gap-xs group/bar\">\n<div class=\"w-full bg-surface-tint opacity-100 h-[30%] rounded-t-sm relative border-2 border-primary-fixed ring-2 ring-prim